<title>USA: Vencor Intl names president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Vencor Intl names president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vencor International Inc on Tuesday said it had named David Harkham as its new president and chief executive officer, replacing J.F. Althoff, who will remain chairman of the company.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said it has completed its transaction with the Hartman Group, which is run by Harkham, under which it will exchange $2.5 million worth of Vencor debt for Vencor common stock issued to the Hartman Group.</p>
<p>Following the transaction, Hartman now owns 51 percent of Vencor's outstanding stock.</p>
</text>
